{"seq":2,"slug":"glicko-uncertainty","title":"Glicko 与不确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/glicko-uncertainty","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"glicko-与不确定性\">Glicko 与不确定性</h1><p>Mark Glickman 抓住了 Elo 的一个软肋：1500 分这个数字，对刚打三局的新人和打了三千局的老将意味着完全不同的可信度，可 Elo 把它们当成同一回事。Glicko 的核心主张是——评分不该是一个点，而该是一段区间；系统应当显式记录「我对这个评分有多大把握」，并据此决定调整幅度与匹配范围。这一步看似只是给评分加了个误差棒，却让评级第一次有了「认识自己无知」的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Glicko 的核心主张是：评分不该是一个点，而该是一段区间。它在评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 之外给每个玩家配一个评分偏差（Rating Deviation，RD），即评分的标准差，显式量化系统对这个数字的把握程度——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RD}=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 的玩家真实实力约 95% 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>RD</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>RD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[R-2\\text{RD}, R+2\\text{RD}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。RD 随对局收缩、随闲置回升，使「调整幅度」从 Elo 那个全局常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 变成因人而异的量，并通过公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>RD</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\text{RD}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 项让不可信的对手贡献更小的信息，整个机制是一台贝叶斯式的信念更新器。Glicko-2 再加第三个量波动度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，区分「噪声」与「真实水平跃迁」。不确定性不只改更新，也该改匹配范围：RD 大就放宽、RD 小就收紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rd-评分的误差棒\">RD：评分的误差棒</h2><p>Glicko 给每个玩家在评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 之外再配一个评分偏差（Rating Deviation，RD），它是评分的标准差，量化系统对这个评分的不确定。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RD}=50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 的玩家，其真实实力以约 95% 置信落在</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>RD</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>RD</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1400</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mn>1600</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\,R - 2\\,\\text{RD},\\; R + 2\\,\\text{RD}\\,] = [\\,1400,\\; 1600\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1400</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1600</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RD</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>350</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RD}=350</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span></span></span></span></span> 的新人，区间宽达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>800</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2200</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[800, 2200]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2200</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>——系统坦承几乎不知道他多强。RD 的动态很关键：每打一局，系统对玩家了解更多，RD 下降；而长期不打，RD 会随时间回升，表示「这个评分可能已经过时」。这恰好解决了 <a href=\"elo-rating\">Elo 评级</a> 里单一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 无法表达的「老手评分陈旧」问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>玩家状态</th>\n<th>典型 RD</th>\n<th>系统态度</th>\n<th>匹配影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全新账号</td>\n<td>~350</td>\n<td>几乎一无所知</td>\n<td>大幅调整、宽松匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活跃熟手</td>\n<td>~50</td>\n<td>高度确信</td>\n<td>小幅调整、严格匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>久未上线</td>\n<td>RD 回升</td>\n<td>把握下降</td>\n<td>重新放宽、加速校准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RD 让「调整幅度」从一个全局常数变成每人每时刻不同的量：RD 大就动得猛、RD 小就动得稳，这正是 Elo 想用分级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 模拟却做不彻底的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不确定性如何进入更新\">不确定性如何进入更新</h2><p>Glicko 的更新公式把 RD 织进了涨跌幅度。一个简化的形态是，评分更新量随对手的不确定性与自身的不确定性共同缩放：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mtext>RD</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>RD</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R&#x27; = R + \\frac{q}{1/\\text{RD}^2 + 1/d^2}\\sum_i g(\\text{RD}_i)\\,\\bigl(S_i - E_i\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3852em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2227em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0273em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不必记公式细节，记住三个直觉即可：其一，对手 RD 越大，他贡献的信息越不可信，对你评分的推动越小（被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>RD</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\text{RD}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 衰减）；其二，你自己 RD 越大，你越容易被单局大幅修正；其三，每次对局后你的 RD 都会收缩，表示把握增加。整个机制是一台贝叶斯式的信念更新器——拿先验（旧评分±RD）与证据（本局结果）合成更可信的后验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[先验: 评分 R 与偏差 RD] --&gt; B[对局结果 S_i]&#10;  B --&gt; C{对手 RD 大不大}&#10;  C -- 大, 证据弱 --&gt; D[小幅调整评分]&#10;  C -- 小, 证据强 --&gt; E[大幅调整评分]&#10;  D --&gt; F[更新后验评分 R&#39;]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[RD 收缩, 把握增加]&#10;  G --&gt; H{长期不打?}&#10;  H -- 是 --&gt; I[RD 随时间回升]&#10;  I --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[先验: 评分 R 与偏差 RD] --&gt; B[对局结果 S_i]\n  B --&gt; C{对手 RD 大不大}\n  C -- 大, 证据弱 --&gt; D[小幅调整评分]\n  C -- 小, 证据强 --&gt; E[大幅调整评分]\n  D --&gt; F[更新后验评分 R']\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[RD 收缩, 把握增加]\n  G --&gt; H{长期不打?}\n  H -- 是 --&gt; I[RD 随时间回升]\n  I --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"glicko-2-再加一个波动度\">Glicko-2：再加一个波动度</h2><p>Glicko-2 在 RD 之上再引入第三个量——波动度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>（volatility），衡量这个玩家近期表现的「不稳定程度」。RD 回答「我们对评分有多确定」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 回答「这个人的真实实力本身是不是正在变」。</p>\n<p>两者区别很实际：一个稳定老手可能 RD 小（很确定）但若他忽然连爆冷，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 会上升，系统据此判断「他可能在变强」从而加快调整。波动度让系统能区分「噪声」与「真实的水平跃迁」——前者不该乱动评分，后者该快速跟上。这三个变量构成 Glicko-2 的完整状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>上升触发</th>\n<th>下降触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>当前实力估计</td>\n<td>赢强者</td>\n<td>输弱者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RD</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对评分的把握</td>\n<td>长期不打</td>\n<td>频繁对局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>实力是否在变</td>\n<td>结果意外、忽强忽弱</td>\n<td>表现稳定一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正因为 Glicko-2 显式跟踪不确定性并给出校准良好的胜率，它在棋联、电竞天梯里被广泛采用——它能更激进地处理不活跃玩家、更快校准新人。这一点直接回应了 <a href=\"../foundations/matchmaking-tradeoffs\">匹配质量与等待权衡</a>：用 RD 收紧匹配范围，可避免「评分虚高」污染对局质量度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rd-如何改写匹配\">RD 如何改写匹配</h2><p>不确定性不只改更新，也该改匹配范围。一个常见做法是把可接受对手范围与双方 RD 挂钩——RD 大时放宽（反正也不确定，先打几局校准），RD 小时收紧（已经很确信，要严格均势）。这与新人的体验直接相关：新账号高 RD 意味着先经历几局宽松（可能不太均势）的定级，换取快速收敛到真实分。如何在队列里落实这种「按不确定性放宽」，是 <a href=\"../matching/constraint-relaxation\">约束放宽</a> 的工程主题；而团队场景下不确定性如何合成，则要交给下一篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Glicko 用评分偏差 RD 把评分从一个点变成一段区间，显式记录系统的把握程度。</li>\n<li>RD 随对局收缩、随闲置回升，使调整幅度因人因时而异，彻底取代 Elo 单一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的笨拙。</li>\n<li>Glicko-2 再加波动度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，区分「噪声」与「真实水平跃迁」，三变量构成完整状态。</li>\n<li>不确定性不仅改更新也该改匹配范围：RD 大放宽、RD 小收紧，避免虚高评分污染质量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>不确定性所要补救的 Elo 固定确定性问题，见 <a href=\"elo-rating\">Elo 评级</a>。</li>\n<li>团队场景下个体不确定性如何合成与分摊，见 <a href=\"trueskill-teams\">TrueSkill 与团队</a>。</li>\n<li>按 RD 放宽匹配范围的工程落地，见 <a href=\"../matching/constraint-relaxation\">约束放宽</a>。</li>\n<li>用统计偏差识别异常表现的思路，与反作弊的 <a href=\"../../game-anti-cheat-security/serverside/statistical-detection\">统计检测</a> 同源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Glicko 与不确定性","id":"glicko-与不确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"RD：评分的误差棒","id":"rd-评分的误差棒"},{"level":2,"text":"不确定性如何进入更新","id":"不确定性如何进入更新"},{"level":2,"text":"Glicko-2：再加一个波动度","id":"glicko-2-再加一个波动度"},{"level":2,"text":"RD 如何改写匹配","id":"rd-如何改写匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"Elo 评级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/elo-rating"},"next":{"title":"TrueSkill 与团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/trueskill-teams"}}